  "details": {
   "description": "For over 85 years, Similac from Abbott Nutrition has set the standards for science-based infant nutrition and has been nourishing babies worldwide. Similac Total Comfort is a spray-dried follow-up formula designed for infants after 12 months onward as part of a healthy diet during and after weaning. Proper hygiene, handling and storage are important when preparing infant formula. Failure to follow these instructions can potentially lead to adverse effects on the health of your baby. Powdered infant formulas are not sterile and should not be fed to premature infants or infants who might have immune problems unless directed and supervised by the physician.",
